  "id": "carrot-and-lentil-soup-with-feta",
  "name": "Carrot and Lentil Soup with Feta",
  "subtitle": "A warmly spiced, creamy vegetable soup finished with chickpeas and feta.",
  "description": "Carrots and red lentils simmer with aromatic spices until tender, then blend into a smooth soup with chickpeas and crumbled feta.",
